                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6840eaf-1e12-447a-b6df-2fd917daa9a6",
                                                "sense_id": "8e49f5a6-3345-38f8-bc7a-8faa1bf8390b",
                                                "text": "The same applied to Loftus-Cheek, who grew into the game after a quiet start and even had the impudence to slip the ball through Marcel Halstenberg’s legs in the first half. Nutmegs aside, Loftus-Cheek also came up with one of England’s best passes of the night, sending Jamie Vardy through the middle at the end of the first half."
